## ৪. `deploy/quotex-bot.service`

```ini
[Unit]
Description=Quotex Signal Bot
After=network.target

[Service]
User=youruser
WorkingDirectory=/opt/quotex-bot
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 /opt/quotex-bot/bot.py
Restart=always
RestartSec=10
StandardOutput=journal
StandardError=journal

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target